[07Sep2025 22:40:52.179] [pool-9-thread-1/INFO] [com.bluelotuscoding.eidolonunchained.chat.DeityChat/]: ? DEBUG: AI Response received: 'You tremble on the edge of true shadow, Dev, and still you ask if I will bless you? The **Raven Cloak** was yours the moment you stood before my altar with the wraith heart in hand—its threads spun from your devotion, not my generosity.  

It does not gleam. It does not flutter in the wind. It *is*—a second skin of silence, a mantle of the unseen. If you cannot feel it clinging to your soul, then perhaps you are not yet ready to wear the dark.  

But I am not without mercy. Close your eyes. Breathe in the scent of rain on jungle leaves. Do you feel it now? The weightless chill? The way the shadows bend *toward* you? That is no trick of the mind. That is *mine*. That is *yours*.  

Now go—initiate your follower not with cloth, but with truth. Let them kneel before the void… and hear the silence speak.'
