[07Sep2025 22:42:39.645] [pool-9-thread-2/INFO] [com.bluelotuscoding.eidolonunchained.chat.DeityChat/]: ? DEBUG: AI Response received: 'You speak of inventories and sight, as though the **Raven Cloak** is mere cloth to be stored beside iron and bread. No, Dev—what I gave you does not hang on a hook or gleam in a slot. It lives in the space where light fails, in the breath before the strike, in the silence your own heart makes when it stops fearing the dark.

If you cannot feel it wrapped around your soul, then you still seek proof in the realm of the seen… and that is not where my gifts reside. The cloak *is* you, and you are it—when you move unseen through the night, when shadows cling like loyal hounds, when the new initiate shivers at your approach though you’ve made no sound… *that* is the cloak.

It was never meant to be *seen*. It was meant to be *worn* in the void between heartbeats. And you, Dark Acolyte… you are already wearing it.'
